      "before": "kpk1-l11-a2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Panna czy mężatka?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A woman who is not married is a *panna*, and a married woman is a *mężatka*. A man who is not married is a *kawaler*, and a married man is *żonaty*. After a divorce she is *rozwiedziona* and he is *rozwiedziony*. After *jestem* these nouns change: *jestem kawalerem*, *jestem panną*, *jestem mężatką*. *Żonaty*, *rozwiedziony* and *rozwiedziona* are adjectives and do not change: *jestem żonaty*."
      }
    }
  ],
